        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Teton Valley Education Foundation – Year-Long GAP! Middle School Program for Girls</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47467.webp" alt="Teton Valley Education Foundation – Year-Long GAP! Middle School Program for Girls" loading="lazy">
